---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as API Layer
    participant DB as Account Database
    participant Notification as Notification Service
    participant CoreBanking as Core Banking System

    Note over Parent,UI: Parent logs in, views dashboard
    Parent->>UI: Login
    UI->>API: Authenticate (OAuth2)
    API->>DB: Validate session, fetch parent/youth accounts
    DB-->>API: Account info
    API-->>UI: Dashboard data
    UI-->>Parent: Dashboard (balance, recent transactions, limit)

    Note over Parent,UI: Parent initiates fund transfer
    Parent->>UI: Initiate fund transfer
    UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/fund-transfer
    API->>DB: Validate source, check funds
    DB-->>API: Funds validated
    API->>CoreBanking: Process transfer
    CoreBanking-->>API: Transfer result
    API->>DB: Update balances, log transaction
    DB-->>API: Updated balances
    API-->>UI: Transfer confirmation
    UI-->>Parent: Transfer result
    API->>Notification: Notify parent/youth

    Note over Parent,UI: Parent sets spending limit
    Parent->>UI: Set weekly limit
    UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/spending-limit
    API->>DB: Update settings
    DB-->>API: Confirmation
    API-->>UI: Limit confirmation
    UI-->>Parent: Limit updated
    API->>Notification: Notify parent

    Note over Parent,UI: Parent views transaction history
    Parent->>UI: View transactions
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/transactions
    API->>DB: Fetch transaction history
    DB-->>API: Transactions
    API-->>UI: Transaction list
    UI-->>Parent: Transaction history

    Note over API: All actions logged for audit
    API->>DB: Audit log (action, user, timestamp)
